":"US5UW1UNB","text":"名前、ddc-ddc のほうがいいなｗ","ts":"1633599843.273100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NMA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"908364c8-0494-4f46-9648-b2d8fcda5875","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"パッチングの単位が変わってしまう問題は `ddc_group#custom#patch_global` みたいな関数を ddc-group で作れば解決しそう","ts":"1633598955.272900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EVV1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1498a90b-9878-4eda-97cb-362852c7ed78","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"```call ddc#custom#alias('source', 'group-often', 'group')\ncall ddc#custom#alias('source', 'group-sometimes', 'group')\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global('sources', ['group-often', 'group-sometimes'])\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global({\n    \\ 'sourceOptions': {\n    \\   'group-often': {\n    \\     'mark': '',\n    \\   },\n    \\ },\n    \\ 'sourceParams': {\n    \\   'group-often': {\n    \\      'sources': ['around', 'vim-lsp'],\n    \\      'srouceOptions': {\n    \\        'around': {\n    \\          'mark': 'A',\n    \\        },\n    \\        'vim-lsp': {\n    \\          'mark': 'LS',\n    \\        },\n    \\      },\n    \\      'srouceParams': {\n    \\      },\n    \\   },\n    \\ }})```\nこういうイメージ。ddc.vim 側が source の class を取れるAPIさえ用意すればサードパーティで ddc-group は作れるかも。","ts":"1633598790.272700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q78qN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c06edf8-9a4f-43c4-a54a-93e589de087b","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"そうするとグルーピングの単位も自在になる\n実質 ddc.vim の実装をするようなものなので、ddc.vim 側にあってもいいような気はする。","ts":"1633598361.271700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bE7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a801ad2-f3e7-4cdb-9131-09d2b2bd2808","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"ddc-group みたいな名前のほうが自然かな","ts":"1633598258.271500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TojIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86274c97-c180-4893-824c-84bc6ff952d7","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"ddc-any-source とか作れば良さそう","ts":"1633598199.271200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n7xlj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d290eb12-0509-4566-8195-af31f633b1f3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ここで直接言っても伝わるとは思いますが、後から見返せる場所にまとまっていると作者としても利用者としてもあとあと便利そうです","ts":"1633593429.270800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cDf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71ae5452-4191-411c-b88d-f31f77613334","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"了解しました，ありがとうございます！","ts":"1633593369.270000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+H1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a376bc21-3a88-422a-a122-e2cdbb2d4d70","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"要望 Issue を立てるとよさそう","ts":"1633593349.269500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fIv6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e041b25b-209d-41f9-bf94-bb98275c8bc9","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"まさに，\u003chttps://github.com/tani/ddc-fuzzy\u003e をいじっていて，欲しくなった昨日でした","ts":"1633593326.268900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"tani/ddc-fuzzy","id":1,"title":"tani/ddc-fuzzy","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"3","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"TypeScript","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"edited":{"user":"U02BDFBM620","ts":"1633593345.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lj8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acca008f-8ee8-4a0a-bea4-0cd6a6097f74","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"上位 priority だが、fuzzy にマッチしている。というものは、下位 priority だが prefix マッチしている候補よりも下に表示